---
import LegalPage from '../../../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import t from '../../../data/en.json';
import site from '../../../data/site.json';
---
<LegalPage locale="en" t={t} title="Privacy Policy" slug="privacy" altSlug="datenschutz">
  <p>
    This policy explains which data is processed when you visit this website. It is based on
    the Swiss Data Protection Act (revDSG) and, where applicable, the European General Data
    Protection Regulation (GDPR).
  </p>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>
    Ebmeyer Consulting, Nadine Ebmeyer, Langackerstrasse 11, 6330 Cham ZG, Switzerland.<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
  </p>
  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>
    This website sets <strong>no cookies</strong> and uses <strong>no analytics or tracking
    services</strong>. No profiles of visitors are created.
  </p>
  <h2>Hosting and server log files</h2>
  <p>
    This website is hosted with {site.legal.hostName} in {site.legal.hostCountryEn}, so the
    data remains on Swiss servers.
  </p>
  <p>
    When the website is accessed, the hosting provider processes technically necessary data
    such as IP address, date and time of access, browser type and operating system. This data
    serves solely the secure and stable operation of the website and is not merged with other
    data sources.
  </p>
  <h2>Booking a call via Calendly</h2>
  <p>
    To book an introductory call, this site links to the external service Calendly. The service
    is <strong>not embedded</strong> in this website: data is only transmitted to Calendly once
    you actively click the link and open the Calendly page. From that point, Calendly's own
    privacy policy applies (Calendly LLC, USA).
  </p>
  <h2>Getting in touch</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact us by email or phone, your details are stored in order to handle your
    enquiry and any follow-up questions. This data is not passed on without your consent.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Information about the data processed about you</li>
    <li>Correction of inaccurate data</li>
    <li>Deletion of your data</li>
    <li>Objection to processing</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
